    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per minute</p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p>You are in tune with the emotions of those around you. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to perception checks to sense motive. If you succeed on a sense motive check (even if it reveals nothing), you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the next Diplomacy, Deception, or Intimidation check you make to interact with the creature.   </p>"
